%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: S12_X1_1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryScene
  sentences:
  - text: all this talk about your past just makes me wonder how old you all really are and what the age differences are.
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I see Scarlet averting her gaze, as if to avoid my question.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 3
      type: 1
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Maybe I shouldn't have asked after all, if it makes her uncomfortable.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Seth seems to have noticed Scarlet's reaction as well.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Well, all I can say is that we all have lived much longer than you and even your parents. Out of all of the organisation Lu is the closest to your age I'd say.
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bbccddeeff00112233445566778899aa, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Mhm. They found me when I was still a child. And I'm the newest member here.
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a7b8c9d0e1f2031445566778899aabbc, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: You're closest to my age? You look a bit younger than me though. I'd say you're a teen.
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Yeah, he's basically a baby. He's only 112 years old.
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f5a7c9d1e2b34567890123456789abcd, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Huh?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: And Seth and I are more than triple that age, haha!
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f5a7c9d1e2b34567890123456789abcd, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I look over at Scarlet.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Then that makes her probably\u2026 well, at least like 500 something,
      right? Or maybe even more."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Don't wrack your brain about my age, it's not important, we age differently after all.
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Sorry, boss. Ray seems to still have a lot of growing up to do.
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bbccddeeff00112233445566778899aa, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Huh, what's that supposed to mean?
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f5a7c9d1e2b34567890123456789abcd, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: It means you're not mature enough to read the room.
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bbccddeeff00112233445566778899aa, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: They continue to bicker until Scarlet finally interrupts. them.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0a531472eb715104e8acc946d055c0dd, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d052a2b3c4d5e6f708192a3b4c5d6e75, type: 2}

